{"ID":"20240314094907-ep2ll8e","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314094907-ep2ll8e","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314094907-ep2ll8e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171753-4ouhbmg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171753-76sieyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171753-76sieyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:31,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:31\u0026#125;","title":"【竹叶石膏汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171753-4ouhbmg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-4ouhbmg","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒解后，虚羸少气，气逆欲吐，竹叶石膏汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-y2dbyqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-y2dbyqx","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"竹叶石膏汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-4myaotd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-4myaotd","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹叶二把石膏一升半夏半升人参三两甘草二两粳米半斤麦门冬一升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-cokeffx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-cokeffx","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水一斗，煑取六升，去滓，纳粳米，煑米熟，汤成去米，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-91z5qoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-91z5qoy","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹叶石膏汤呢，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚热，胃的津液不够了，热往上冲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为你津液不够的原因可能是你在治病的时候发表发得太过，让病人流汗流得太多。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那用竹叶、石膏这种把胃热降下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，清胃热的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏呢能够去恶心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为有恶心嘛，恶心代表可能有停水在胃里面，排不出来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麦门冬呢能够滋润它肺里面的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"粳米呢滋润肠胃里面的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参粳米这种都是很好的能够把津液补回去的一种药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你一看这个处方就知道是胃热。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-g3wvmjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-g3wvmjb","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而这个处方呢，竹叶石膏汤我们常常用在糖尿病病人身上。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"糖尿病人呢，常常会有虚赢少气，这个气逆欲呕，恶心的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。各位记得，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实症，胃里面有水，实症的恶心啊，我们都会用到生姜啊，半夏啊这种东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是虚证的恶心呢，胃里面没有东西，但是因为肝肿起来顶到胃造成的恶心，叫虚证的恶心，这就是吴茱萸汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以吴茱萸汤可以止呕，半夏也可以止呕。什么时候用半夏，什么时候用吴茱萸？就要你临床的辩证，就可以看出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-9gsra37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-9gsra37","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，大家不要紧张，在临床上的时候眼睛一看就知道了。用Commonsense 就好了，我讲过哦。我看到你还没看到，我解释给你听你还没看到，你也不用来了哦。欢迎大家来临床，但是就是要放轻松心情，我不会考你，你放心好了，我不会考你哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171753-76sieyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171753-76sieyy","updated":"20240422171753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家考试已经很多了，累死了，到我这边还考！哦，不会，不可能的。"}]}]}